    <preface>
      <p>Trade Support Loans Amendment (Improving Administration) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 20, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Trade Support Loans Act 2014</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Trade Support Loans Act 2014	3</p>
      <p>Trade Support Loans Amendment (Improving Administration) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 20, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Trade Support Loans Act 2014</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 6 March 2020</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Trade Support Loans Amendment (Improving Administration)</i><i> Act 20</i><i>20</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  Sections 1 to 3 and anything in this Act not elsewhere covered by this table</td>
              <td>The day this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>6 March 2020</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2. Schedule 1</td>
              <td>The day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>7 March 2020</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Trade Support Loans Act 2014</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 11(1)(a)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “(the <b><i>final instalment period</i></b>)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 11(1)(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>apart from this section, some or all of the amount is not payable to the person in relation to the instalment period; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 11(1)(c)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “section”, substitute “subsection”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 11(1)(e)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “final”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Subsection 11(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “this section”, substitute “subsection (1)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 11</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-3">
                  <num>3</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>If:</p>
                  </content>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-3__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>an amount paid to a person is taken under subsection (1) to have been an instalment of a trade support loan in relation to an instalment period; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-3__para-b">
                    <num>b</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(b)	an instalment of a trade support loan (a <b><i>later instalment</i></b>) is payable (or would apart from this subsection be payable) to the person in relation to a later instalment period;</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p><role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role> may determine that the amount of the later instalment is to be reduced (including reduced to nil). However, the sum of all such reductions connected with the amount mentioned in paragraph (a) must not exceed that amount.</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                  <num>4</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>The rules may prescribe circumstances in which <role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role> is to determine under subsection (3) that amounts of later instalments are to be reduced.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 60(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “<quantity refersTo="#deadline">within 14 days</quantity>”, insert “, or within such longer period as is specified under paragraph 62(2)(c),”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>At the end of subsection 62(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; and (c)	may specify a period, longer than 14 days, for informing <role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role> of a change of the person’s address.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>Subsection 72(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “7 days”, substitute “14 days”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-10">
              <num>10</num>
              <heading>After subsection 90(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-10__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-10__qstr-1__subsec-4A">
                  <num>4A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not apply to a payment to the extent that it is covered by a determination under subsection 11(1).</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>11  Application provision</p>
                    <p>The amendments made by this Schedule to <ref href="#sec-11">section 11</ref> of the <i>Trade Support Loans Act 2014</i> do not apply in relation to amounts paid before the commencement of this Schedule.</p>
                    <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                    <p><i>House of Representatives on 28 November 2019</i></p>
                    <p><i>Senate on 10 February 2020</i>]</p>
                    <p>(231/19)</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
    </attachments>
  </act>
